OL,3,GNEWSATickets for Christmas lottery go
OL,4,Aon sale
OL,5,
OL,6,FTickets for the Channel Islands
OL,7,FChristmas Lottery have gone on sale
OL,8,Fwith a "guaranteed top prize of
OL,9,F#300,000 that will increase as sales
OL,10,Fgrow", organisers have said.
OL,12,FJointly run by the States of Guernsey
OL,13,Fand Government of Jersey, the lottery
OL,14,Fhas returned for its 51st year with the
OL,15,Fmain draw set to take place in Guernsey
OL,16,Fon 17 December.
OL,18,FOrganisers said the lottery had raised
OL,19,F"tens of millions" for charities in the
OL,20,Fislands since it started in 1975.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
